    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d235-a1">

                <pb facs="0269" n="187" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg187"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-08-22"><hi rendition="#small-caps">August</hi> 22,
                            1911</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 8.</seg></opener>
                <p>The resignation of President Alfaro was presented to Congress and promptly
                    accepted by that body. A review of the election of last January was then,
                    undertaken, and in due time its results—102,000 votes for Estrada as against
                    3,000 for Gen. Alfaro—were announced, and Emilio Estrada was duly declared to
                    have been legally and constitutionally elected President of the Republic.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Evan E. Young.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
